		},
		{
			"id": "title",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Time Series Course Atlas\n\nHeptabase-style prototype for [[Time Series Analysis-hub|时间序列分析 Hub]].\n\n远看：整门课的地形。近看：每张卡片的角色、入口和相邻关系。",
			"x": -1587,
			"y": -1049,
			"width": 720,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "foundation-probability",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Probability review\n\n入口：[[00_导论与概率论复习]]\n\n作用：给全课提供随机过程语言。\n\n关键词：条件期望、收敛、LLN、CLT、无偏性、一致性。",
			"x": -1523,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "foundation-asymptotics",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Asymptotic tools\n\n卡片：[[Law of Large Numbers]] · [[Central Limit Theorem]]\n\n作用：解释估计量为什么可以收敛、检验统计量为什么有极限分布。\n\n在考试里经常藏在推断步骤背后。",
			"x": -1523,
			"y": -207,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "foundation-course-four-parts",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Four-part course map\n\n[[00_导论与概率论复习]] 里已经给出整门课四块：\n\n1. [[ARMA]]：平稳单变量均值模型\n2. [[ARCH]] / [[GARCH]]：条件方差模型\n3. [[VAR Model]]：多变量动态系统\n4. Nonstationary time series：单位根、趋势、协整\n\n这张图就是把这四块摊成空间地图。",
			"x": -1139,
			"y": -207,
			"width": 550,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "baseline-arma",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ARMA core\n\n入口：[[03_平稳时间序列模型]]\n\n卡片：[[ARMA]] · [[Autoregressive Model]] · [[Moving Average Model]]\n\n角色：平稳单变量序列的基准模型。\n\n它回答：当前值如何由过去值和过去冲击解释？",
			"x": -141,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "baseline-stationary-condition",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Stationarity / invertibility\n\n核心判断：AR 特征根在单位圆外，MA 部分可逆。\n\n作用：保证模型不是随机游走或爆炸过程，ACF/PACF 才有稳定含义。\n\n上游来自：差分方程与特征根。",
			"x": 307,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "baseline-arima",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ARIMA as fallback\n\n卡片：[[ARIMA]] · [[First Difference]]\n\n角色：当原序列有单位根但差分后可建模时，用差分把问题拉回 ARMA。\n\n它连接了平稳模型区和非平稳区。",
			"x": 83,
			"y": -146,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "baseline-box-jenkins",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Box-Jenkins loop\n\n卡片：[[Box-Jenkins Method]] · [[ARMA Model Identification Steps]]\n\n循环：识别候选模型 -> 估计 -> 诊断残差 -> 预测。\n\n这不是一个知识点，而是一条操作流程。",
			"x": 550,
			"y": -146,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "legend",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## How to read this canvas\n\n- **Blue / purple**: 前置语言和动态系统语法\n- **Green**: ARMA 作为单变量平稳模型主干\n- **Yellow**: 识别、诊断、预测这条操作线\n- **Orange**: ARMA 残差方差仍有结构时，进入 ARCH/GARCH\n- **Red**: 平稳性失败后，进入单位根、协整、ECM\n\n卡片里的链接都指向原课程笔记或 Factase 卡片。",
			"x": -563,
			"y": -1049,
			"width": 820,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "course-spine",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Course spine\n\n这门课不是章节堆叠，而是一个建模决策树：\n\n1. 先判断序列能否作为平稳过程处理。\n2. 平稳单变量先用 ARMA 建均值模型。\n3. 残差均值干净但方差有结构，进入 ARCH/GARCH。\n4. 多个变量共同运动，进入 ADL / VAR / IRF。\n5. 非平稳但有长期关系，进入 Cointegration / ECM。",
			"x": 614,
			"y": -1049,
			"width": 780,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "foundation-iid-mds-wn",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## IID / MDS / White noise\n\n卡片：[[IID]] · [[Martingale Difference Sequence]] · [[White Noise]]\n\n作用：区分“不可预测”“不相关”“独立”。\n\n后面所有残差诊断都在问：误差是否还留下可利用结构？",
			"x": -1139,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "foundation-stationarity",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Stationarity\n\n卡片：[[Stationarity]] · [[Strict-Sense Stationary Process]] · [[Wide-Sense Stationary Process]]\n\n作用：决定是否能直接用 ACF/PACF 和 ARMA。\n\n这是进入全课模型区的门槛。",
			"x": -755,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "grammar-lag-diff",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Lag and difference operators\n\n入口：[[02_差分方程Difference Equation]]\n\n卡片：[[Lag Operator]] · [[Difference Operator]] · [[First Difference]]\n\n作用：把动态关系写成可操作的多项式语言。",
			"x": -1523,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "grammar-difference-equation",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Difference equation\n\n卡片：[[Difference Equation]]\n\n作用：理解一个系统为什么会收敛、单位根、爆炸。\n\n它是 ARMA 平稳性判断的数学底座。",
			"x": -1139,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "grammar-ar1-stability",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## AR(1) stability\n\n卡片：[[AR(1) stationarity]] · [[Random Walk]]\n\n角色：最低维的动态直觉。\n\n如果 AR(1) 都看不出收敛、单位根、爆炸，后面的 ARMA 根条件会变成死记硬背。",
			"x": -717,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "grammar-characteristic-root",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Characteristic-root thinking\n\n从差分方程到 ARMA 的桥：\n\n- 差分方程：看特征根判断动态路径\n- ARMA：看算子多项式根判断平稳/可逆\n\n这一块的任务是建立“根的位置决定系统行为”的直觉。",
			"x": -1331,
			"y": 842,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 210,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "baseline-acf-pacf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ACF / PACF\n\n卡片：[[Autocorrelation Function]] · [[Partial Autocorrelation Function]]\n\n角色：从样本图形猜模型阶数。\n\nAR 看 PACF 截尾，MA 看 ACF 截尾，ARMA 通常两者拖尾。",
			"x": 755,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "diagnostics-identification",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Identification\n\n从图形和准则提出候选模型：\n\n- ACF / PACF 看结构\n- [[AIC]] / [[BIC]] 平衡拟合和复杂度\n- 不要只凭一个指标决定模型",
			"x": -141,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "diagnostics-aic-bic",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## AIC / BIC\n\n卡片：[[AIC]] · [[BIC]]\n\n角色：模型阶数选择工具。\n\nAIC 更愿意保留复杂模型，BIC 对参数惩罚更重。",
			"x": 307,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "diagnostics-residual",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Residual diagnosis\n\n卡片：[[White Noise Test]]\n\n问题：ARMA 拟合后，残差是否还存在可预测结构？\n\n如果残差不白，均值模型还不够；如果残差平方有结构，转向 ARCH/GARCH。",
			"x": 755,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "diagnostics-forecast",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Forecasting\n\n角色：把模型变成交付物。\n\n关键词：one-step / multi-step forecast，rolling window，expanding window。\n\n预测不是模型结束，而是模型是否有用的检验。",
			"x": 83,
			"y": 866,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "diagnostics-evaluation",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Forecast evaluation\n\n卡片：[[Forecast Evaluation]] · [[Granger-Newbold Test]] · [[Diebold-Mariano Test]]\n\n角色：比较两个预测模型谁更好。\n\n这块把“能拟合”推进到“是否真的预测更好”。",
			"x": 550,
			"y": 866,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "volatility-motivation",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Why volatility modeling?\n\n入口：[[04_波动建模 Modeling Volatility]]\n\n卡片：[[Conditional Heteroskedasticity]] · [[Volatility Clustering]]\n\n角色：均值模型可能干净，但风险/方差仍随时间变化。",
			"x": 1472,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "volatility-arch",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ARCH\n\n卡片：[[ARCH]]\n\n角色：用过去残差平方解释当前条件方差。\n\n核心直觉：大的冲击后，下一期更可能仍然高波动。",
			"x": 1920,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "volatility-garch",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## GARCH\n\n卡片：[[GARCH]]\n\n角色：用更少参数捕捉长期波动记忆。\n\nGARCH(1,1) 是这块的实证主力。",
			"x": 2342,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "volatility-tests",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Detect ARCH effects\n\n卡片：[[ARCH LM Test]] · [[McLeod-Li Test]]\n\n入口问题：ARMA 残差平方是否有自相关？\n\n显著时说明“均值已经建了，但方差还没建”。",
			"x": 1574,
			"y": -146,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "volatility-extensions",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Extensions\n\n卡片：[[IGARCH]] · [[ARCH-M]] · [[TARCH]] · [[EGARCH]]\n\n角色：处理高度持久、风险收益关系和非对称冲击。\n\n考试优先级通常低于 ARCH/GARCH 主线。",
			"x": 2099,
			"y": -146,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "multi-intervention",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Intervention / IRF\n\n入口：[[05_多方程模型Multi-equation Time Series Models]]\n\n卡片：[[Intervention Analysis]] · [[Impulse Response Function]]\n\n角色：一个政策或冲击如何沿时间传播？",
			"x": 1472,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "multi-adl",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ADL / transfer function\n\n卡片：[[ADL]] · [[Distributed Lag Model]] · [[Transfer Function Model]]\n\n角色：外生变量 z 如何通过滞后影响 y？",
			"x": 1920,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "multi-var",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## VAR system\n\n卡片：[[VAR Model]] · [[Reduced Form VAR]] · [[Structural VAR]]\n\n角色：多个变量都可能互相影响时，把系统整体建模。",
			"x": 2342,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "multi-granger",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Granger causality\n\n卡片：[[Granger Causality Test]]\n\n角色：过去的 x 是否帮助预测 y？\n\n它是预测意义上的因果，不等于结构因果。",
			"x": 1574,
			"y": 878,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "multi-irf-vd",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## IRF / variance decomposition\n\n卡片：[[Impulse Response Function]] · [[Variance Decomposition]]\n\n角色：VAR 估计后，解释冲击如何传播、哪个变量贡献了多少预测误差。",
			"x": 2022,
			"y": 878,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstationary-trend",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Trend models\n\n入口：[[06_含趋势的模型]]\n\n角色：先区分确定性趋势和随机趋势。\n\n关键问题：去趋势够不够，还是必须差分？",
			"x": 3034,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstationary-unit-root",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Unit root tests\n\n卡片：[[Unit Root Test]] · [[Augmented Dickey-Fuller Test]] · [[Phillips-Perron Test]] · [[KPSS Test]]\n\n角色：判断平稳性失败的类型。",
			"x": 3482,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstationary-spurious",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Spurious regression\n\n卡片：[[Spurious Regression]]\n\n角色：警告你不能把两个非平稳序列直接回归后就解释 R² 和 t 值。\n\n这是非平稳区的风险提示牌。",
			"x": 3917,
			"y": -549,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstationary-cointegration",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Cointegration\n\n入口：[[07_协整和误差修正模型]]\n\n卡片：[[Cointegration]] · [[Common Stochastic Trend]]\n\n角色：多个 I(1) 变量虽然各自乱走，但某个线性组合可能稳定。",
			"x": 3034,
			"y": -171,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstationary-ecm",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ECM / VECM\n\n卡片：[[Error Correction Model]] · [[Cointegration theorem]]\n\n角色：同时表达短期波动和长期均衡纠偏。\n\n一句话：偏离长期关系后，系统怎样被拉回来？",
			"x": 3482,
			"y": -171,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstationary-eg",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Engle-Granger test\n\n卡片：[[Engle-Granger Two-Step Test]]\n\n角色：两步检验协整。\n\n先估长期关系，再检验残差是否平稳。",
			"x": 3917,
			"y": -171,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstationary-johansen",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Johansen test\n\n卡片：[[Johansen Cointegration Test]] · [[Johansen Cointegration Test Steps]]\n\n角色：系统地检验多个协整向量。\n\n关键对象：矩阵 rank、trace test、max-eigen test。",
			"x": 3264,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "exam-start",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Exam checkpoint 1\n\n拿到一条序列，先问：\n\n- 是否平稳？\n- 是否有趋势？\n- 是否需要差分？\n\n不要一上来就套 ARMA。",
			"x": -1523,
			"y": 1476,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "exam-arma",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Exam checkpoint 2\n\n如果可以平稳处理：\n\nACF/PACF -> 候选 ARMA -> AIC/BIC -> 残差白噪声检验 -> 预测。",
			"x": -1062,
			"y": 1476,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "exam-volatility",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Exam checkpoint 3\n\n如果残差本身不相关，但残差平方相关：\n\n进入 ARCH/GARCH，而不是继续堆 ARMA 阶数。",
			"x": -602,
			"y": 1476,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "exam-nonstationary",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Exam checkpoint 5\n\n如果变量非平稳：\n\n单变量：差分后 ARIMA。\n\n多个 I(1) 变量：先问是否协整；若有协整，用 ECM / Johansen 路线。",
			"x": 435,
			"y": 1476,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "exam-multi",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Exam checkpoint 4\n\n如果问题是多个变量之间的传导：\n\nADL / transfer function 处理外生输入；VAR 处理系统联动；IRF 解释冲击路径。",
			"x": -51,
			"y": 1476,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		}
	],
